-- ('73032bf7-6b3c-4ce9-8cb8-8a6c7fca4845','786495b2-c779-4cc4-b812-6a8439bfa96e',NULL,'<p><span style="color: rgb(62, 65, 69);">Worker planning to go to the home to interview Zachary again. Dylan is staying with his girlfriend''s family, plan was made before the Department was involved. Zachary can continue to stay where he is. Worker made a referral to Bester Community of Hope. Mother is seeking employment and recently had interviews at Hempen Hill and Seven-Ten bowling alley. Mother spoke with North Hagerstown High School about getting Dylan reconnected with a therapist at school since family currently does not have transportation.</span></p>','intake','I202000256650',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:53:11.000',NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:53:39.000',NULL,true,'87e6906c-93b7-43d3-a906-3411ecb3cf06','2020-01-22 00:00:00.000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,false,0,NULL,'2020-01-22 08:48:00.000','2020-01-22 08:53:00.000',1,true,false,NULL,NULL,'','0:5','SV',NULL,NULL,NULL,false,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,'Y',NULL,'{"data": []}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL)
-- ,('8910e468-a677-45f8-bdef-c41a16ba177e','786495b2-c779-4cc4-b812-6a8439bfa96e',NULL,'<p>Child has a bite mark on left bicep, green in color, and a small scratch on the back of his neck.  Mom has some bruising on the back of her leg and head.  Child has been physically assaultive with parents and admits this.  Child has a therapist and has been in PHP.  Mom states child was swinging from behind to hit her again and she admitting to biting him to keep him from hitting again, then grabbed his shirt and pushed him outside to separate them.  Child was very affectionate during the visit with his parents, he has severe separation anxiety that began during a stint of reunification.  Parents are doing what they can, however child is able to overpower them.  Mom feels child could go inpatient, however is concerned regarding his separation anxiety.  Worker discussed referral for MST and discussed calling 911 in the future when child is being physically aggressive.  Parents advise they do not use physical discipline and have not in years.</p>','intake','I202000256650',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:48:55.000',NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:48:55.000',NULL,true,'87e6906c-93b7-43d3-a906-3411ecb3cf06','2020-01-22 00:00:00.000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,false,0,NULL,'2020-01-22 08:43:00.000','2020-01-22 08:48:00.000',1,true,false,NULL,NULL,'','0:5','SV',NULL,NULL,NULL,false,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,'Y',NULL,'{"data": []}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL)
-- ,('9b02a502-b9b3-462f-9932-5e1087efedc1','786495b2-c779-4cc4-b812-6a8439bfa96e',NULL,'<p>Worker has seen the child.  Mother was to come in to see worker on Friday afternoon but did not show, however she then called and texted worker stating she had picked up Mr. Mock from the hospital.  Worker is attempting to reschedule home visit, she will attempt an unannounced visit this afternoon after child returns home from school.  Worker discussed with mother the need to verbalize a plan for someone to care for Jordan when she is not home or unavailable.  During visits child has been clean, dressed appropriately, he appears street smart.</p>','intake','I202000256650',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:58:07.000',NULL,NULL,'2749e1a9-7e03-45ec-9127-cbdd9870b55d','2020-01-22 08:58:07.000',NULL,true,'87e6906c-93b7-43d3-a906-3411ecb3cf06','2020-01-22 00:00:00.000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,false,0,NULL,'2020-01-22 08:53:00.000','2020-01-22 08:58:00.000',1,true,false,NULL,NULL,'','0:5','SV',NULL,NULL,NULL,false,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,'Y',NULL,'{"data": []}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL)
